<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <title>400 &ndash; Bad request</title>
  <style>
    body { background: #1a1a2e; color: #eee; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; margin: 0; }
    .header { background: #003366; padding: 10px 20px; display: flex; align-items: center; }
    .header h1 { color: #fff; font-size: 16px; margin: 0; }
    .logo { color: #00aaff; font-weight: bold; font-size: 20px; margin-right: 15px; }
    .container { max-width: 460px; margin: 70px auto; background: #252540; padding: 26px; border-radius: 4px; border-top: 3px solid #003366; }
    h2 { color: #aac8ff; font-size: 15px; margin-top: 0; }
    p { font-size: 13px; color: #ccc; }
    .footer { margin-top: 18px; font-size: 11px; color: #666; text-align: center; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="header">
    <span class="logo">SIEMENS</span>
    <h1>SIMATIC WinCC Web Navigator</h1>
  </div>
  <div class="container">
    <h2>400 &ndash; Bad request</h2>
    <p>The runtime could not interpret the request.</p>
    <div class="footer"><condata source="databus" key="sysName" /> &bull; <condata source="databus" key="ModuleType" /></div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
